#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:103
msgid "xAI API key"
msgstr "xAI API 密钥"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:104
msgid "Select a Key containing an API key created in the xAI Console."
msgstr "选择一个包含在 xAI 控制台中创建的 API 密钥的密钥。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:110
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "高级设置"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:111
msgid ""
"These settings control how the provider connects to xAI and selects between "
"the legacy Chat Completions transport and the newer Responses transport. The "
"defaults are appropriate for most sites. Change them only when required by "
"your hosting environment, privacy policy, or integration workflow."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:121
msgid "API base URL"
msgstr "API 基础 URL"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:123
msgid ""
"The HTTPS base URL used for xAI inference and model-discovery requests. Keep "
"the official <code>https://api.x.ai/v1</code> endpoint unless your "
"organization uses an approved xAI-compatible gateway or regional proxy. URLs "
"containing credentials, query strings, or fragments are rejected to protect "
"the selected API key."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:128
msgid "Transport"
msgstr "传输方式"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:130
msgid "Automatic (recommended)"
msgstr "自动（推荐）"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:131
msgid "Chat Completions only"
msgstr "仅 Chat Completions"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:132
msgid "Responses API for compatible requests"
msgstr "对兼容请求使用 Responses API"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:135
msgid ""
"<strong>Automatic</strong> uses Chat Completions for ordinary Drupal AI and "
"Drupal function-tool requests, then switches to Responses when an xAI-hosted "
"tool is requested. <strong>Chat Completions only</strong> provides the "
"broadest compatibility but prevents hosted Web Search, X Search, Code "
"Interpreter, Collections Search, and remote MCP. <strong>Responses API</"
"strong> prefers Responses for compatible non-streaming requests; Drupal "
"function tools and ordinary streaming continue to use Chat Completions until "
"equivalent Responses support is available."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:140
msgid "Allow xAI to store Responses API requests"
msgstr "允许 xAI 存储 Responses API 请求"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:142
msgid ""
"Controls xAI server-side storage for requests sent through the Responses "
"API. It is disabled by default, causing the provider to send "
"<code>store=false</code>. Enable it only when your privacy and data-"
"retention policies allow prompts, uploaded content, tool activity, and "
"responses to be retained by xAI. Storage is required for future workflows "
"that continue a conversation using a previous response ID, but it is not "
"required for normal Drupal AI chat history."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:146
msgid "Responses request timeout"
msgstr "Responses 请求超时"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:150
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "秒"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:151
msgid ""
"The maximum time Drupal waits for a synchronous Responses API request. "
"Hosted searches, code execution, collections, MCP calls, and reasoning "
"models may take longer than ordinary chat. Increase this value for complex "
"workflows, or reduce it to release PHP workers sooner when an upstream "
"request stalls. Your web server, PHP runtime, reverse proxy, or hosting "
"platform may enforce a shorter timeout."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:166
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "测试连接"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:178
msgid "Test connection and load models"
msgstr "测试连接并加载模型"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:192
msgid "Default Grok model"
msgstr "默认 Grok 模型"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:196
msgid ""
"Test the connection to load the models available to the selected API key."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:197
msgid ""
"Used as this provider’s default chat, vision, tools, and structured-output "
"model."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:213
msgid "Hosted tool permissions"
msgstr "托管工具权限"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:214
msgid ""
"These settings permit tools at site level. Individual requests must still "
"select a permitted tool. Hosted tools can incur additional xAI charges."
msgstr ""
"这些设置在站点级别允许工具。每个请求仍须选择已允许的工具。托管工具可能产生额"
"外的 xAI 费用。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:224
msgid "Permit Web Search"
msgstr "允许网页搜索"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:225
msgid ""
"Allows Grok to search and browse the public web for current information. "
"Requests can optionally restrict searches to allowed or excluded domains and "
"enable image search or image understanding. xAI charges separately for "
"hosted search calls."
msgstr ""
"允许 Grok 搜索和浏览公共网络以获取最新信息。请求可以限制允许或排除的域名，并"
"启用图像搜索或理解。xAI 会对托管搜索单独收费。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:228
msgid "Permit X Search"
msgstr "允许 X 搜索"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:229
msgid ""
"Allows Grok to search public posts, users, and threads on X. Individual "
"requests can restrict handles and dates or enable image and video "
"understanding. xAI charges separately for hosted search calls."
msgstr ""
"允许 Grok 搜索 X 上的公开帖子、用户和话题。请求可以限制账号和日期，或启用图像"
"与视频理解。xAI 会对托管搜索单独收费。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:232
msgid "Permit Code Interpreter"
msgstr "允许代码解释器"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:233
msgid ""
"Allows Grok to write and execute Python in an isolated environment managed "
"by xAI. It is useful for calculations and data analysis. The environment has "
"no access to this Drupal site unless data is included in the prompt, and "
"tool calls may incur additional charges."
msgstr ""
"允许 Grok 在 xAI 管理的隔离环境中编写并执行 Python，适用于计算和数据分析。除"
"非提示中包含数据，否则该环境无法访问此 Drupal 站点。工具调用可能产生额外费"
"用。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:236
msgid "Permit Collections Search"
msgstr "允许集合搜索"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:237
msgid ""
"Allows Grok to search xAI collections containing previously uploaded "
"documents. Individual requests must provide permitted collection IDs. "
"Collection storage, retrieval, and search can incur additional xAI charges."
msgstr ""
"允许 Grok 搜索包含已上传文档的 xAI 集合。请求必须提供已允许的集合 ID。集合存"
"储、检索和搜索可能产生额外费用。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:240
msgid "Permit allowlisted remote MCP servers"
msgstr "允许已列入许可名单的远程 MCP 服务器"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:241
msgid ""
"Allows xAI to connect Grok to explicitly allowlisted remote MCP servers. "
"Each server must use HTTPS and expose only the tool names listed below. "
"Enable this only for trusted servers because MCP tools may read or modify "
"external systems."
msgstr ""
"允许 xAI 将 Grok 连接到明确列入允许名单的远程 MCP 服务器。服务器必须使用 "
"HTTPS，并仅公开下列工具。MCP 工具可能读取或修改外部系统，因此只应为可信服务器"
"启用。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:254
msgid "Remote MCP server allowlist"
msgstr "远程 MCP 服务器许可名单"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:256
msgid ""
"One server per line: label|https://server.example/mcp|"
"allowed_tool_1,allowed_tool_2. An explicit allowed-tools list is required."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:266
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:275
msgid ""
"After saving a working xAI API key and default Grok model, connect Grok to "
"the Drupal AI features that should use it:"
msgstr ""
"保存有效的 xAI API 密钥和默认 Grok 模型后，将 Grok 连接到需要使用它的 Drupal "
"AI 功能："

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:281
msgid ""
"Use <strong>Test connection and load models</strong>, select the Grok model "
"you want this provider to use by default, and save this form."
msgstr ""
"使用<strong>测试连接并加载模型</strong>，选择此提供商默认使用的 Grok 模型，然"
"后保存表单。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:276
msgid ""
"To use Grok in CKEditor, enable the <strong>AI CKEditor integration</strong> "
"module, then open <a href=\":url\">Text formats and editors</a>. Edit each "
"CKEditor 5 text format that needs AI, add the AI button to its active "
"toolbar, enable the required AI actions, and select <strong>Grok (xAI)</"
"strong> with a Grok chat model for each action, or verify that the action "
"uses the site-wide Chat default. Also grant the appropriate roles the "
"<em>use ai ckeditor</em> permission."
msgstr ""
"要在 CKEditor 中使用 Grok，请启用 <strong>AI CKEditor 集成</strong>模块，然后"
"打开<a href=\":url\">文本格式和编辑器</a>。编辑每个需要 AI 的 CKEditor 5 文本"
"格式，将 AI 按钮添加到启用的工具栏，启用所需的 AI 操作，并为每个操作选择 "
"<strong>Grok (xAI)</strong> 和 Grok 聊天模型，或确认该操作使用全站 Chat 默认"
"设置。还要向适当的角色授予 <em>use ai ckeditor</em> 权限。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:285
msgid ""
"Review each Drupal AI module or feature you enable. Configure it to use the "
"site-wide Chat default, or select Grok explicitly when that feature provides "
"its own provider and model settings."
msgstr ""
"检查每个已启用的 Drupal AI 模块或功能。将其配置为使用全站 Chat 默认值；若该功"
"能有独立设置，则明确选择 Grok。"

#: src/Form/GrokAiProviderConfigForm.php:287
msgid ""
"To use xAI-hosted tools, permit them in <strong>Hosted tool permissions</"
"strong>, then enable the permitted tools in the individual model or request "
"configuration that needs them."
msgstr ""
"要使用 xAI 托管工具，请先在<strong>托管工具权限</strong>中允许它们，再在需要"
"这些工具的模型或请求配置中启用。"

